Thank you for contacting EverQuote. We reviewed the lead returns that were currently rejected and saw that some of the leads were returned for consumers claiming to have not requested a quote or were not interested in receiving quotes. We will not be able to accept these returns since we have records showing that the consumers did fill out our online form and requested for a quote. Since all of our leads are originally sourced through our web properties, we are able to track where they came from and when they filled out the form. As a result, we do not typically accept lead returns for consumers claiming to have not requested a quote.

Please feel free to let us know if you have any additional questions regarding this matter or anything else on your account.

